{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "50cbd1bfbd3c74fcf51a8df12d841570ec91ec0acfe1c5b92516112671f0bf91", "ja": "Live in パーク□", "zh": "Live in 公园□", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "bdbf3f4e1ebce1245de453fc42db7d229081f3ed8a5b1dcb4f63ecee1b33173b", "ja": "記念式典は楽しく終わり、見ていた園長も大\n絶賛。亜美達が公園を残して欲しいとお願い\nすると、リニューアルを約束してくれた。亜\n美は大喜びし、プロデューサーに元気いっぱ\nいないたずらを仕掛けるのだった。", "zh": "纪念典礼愉快地结束了，观看典礼的园长也大加赞赏。\n当亚美她们请求他保留这座公园时，\n他答应对公园进行改造。\n亚美欣喜若狂，随后对制作人使出了活力十足的恶作剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "34a1b9b382417e1adfd168be124a10beb7b92891c68821c0860ba42bb953d696", "ja": "（ミリオンパークの記念式典は、無事に終わった。\nよく頑張ったな、みんな！）", "zh": "（百万公园的纪念典礼顺利结束了。大家都很努力啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1001_011ami", "source_sha256": "a35e640e0a17d2e44226f88a1c3ea87a6992b7420a57ff2c89d088aea3dda60b", "ja": "兄ちゃん！　今日はパレードとかライブとか\nやるコトいっぱいで、メチャ楽しかったね！", "zh": "哥哥！今天又是游行又是演唱会，要做的事情好多，真的超级开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0c2f93599bad24b76273e383da888fd5195f517e69af7573cb9431818165a66e", "ja": "ああ、すごい盛り上がりだったな！\nお客さん達にも、いい思い出になったと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，现场气氛真是太热烈了！\n我想对客人们来说，也会成为一段美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "5dd282dd763998cbd2f209215a4a974404446150122aec7a116da22dde3460ef", "ja": "これで、公園もなくなったりしないよな？\nだってみんな、あんなに楽しそうだったんだしさ！", "zh": "这样公园不会就此消失吧？\n毕竟大家刚才都玩得那么开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "89a0c580a8eb162e31607fd9d3c8eef98beda2ba7f550490e50f30a3e50c54e8", "ja": "昴ちゃん、それは……。", "zh": "昴，那个……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1005_mirionpakuenntyou", "source_sha256": "d0aa01bf38cc96bea13a6f300b5c6c9641f4993efe653219853edd63982642ab", "ja": "765プロのみなさん、お疲れ様でした！\n私、ミリオンパークの園長です。", "zh": "765事务所的各位，辛苦大家了！\n我是MILLION PARK的园长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "69a36e62e446cb79b7c02560c5a13d65444c5800fac461dbcbe0111b1f83d6fb", "ja": "えっ！？　園長さんが、なんでここに……ハッ！\nまさか茜ちゃんを、パークのマスコットキャラに！？", "zh": "诶！？园长您怎么会在这里……啊！\n难道是想把小茜设为公园的吉祥物！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1007_p", "source_sha256": "66d7f689b9e7d1e9b78a69e14ecc458c252d189a34d4da598728b6b7bbed7ef2", "ja": "お世話になっています、765プロです！\nわざわざすみません。", "zh": "一直承蒙关照，765制作人！特意让您跑一趟，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1008_mirionpakuenntyou", "source_sha256": "5145b017d48e0c1ebd9c4cca73c365f23cc8360a0cbfc596156d4fb43deae4a9", "ja": "いやいや、イイものを見せてもらいましたよ。\nこんなに楽しい気持ちになったのは、久しぶりです！", "zh": "哎呀，真是让我看到了精彩的东西啊。\n好久没有这么开心过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1009_011ami", "source_sha256": "9c3c4216db01decfdfedde38b95fe24b5f2571c643fa81f868537a14edfa66cf", "ja": "でしょでしょ！？\nそう思ったら、この公園壊さないでよ～！", "zh": "对吧对吧！？既然你也这么觉得，就别把这个公园弄坏啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "f3e58d3706ba92556f62c6872389fed66fdf110d568baa46752f703100ac183c", "ja": "そうそう！　お願いだよ、オッサ……おじさん！", "zh": "对对！拜托了，大叔……不，叔叔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "50ed2d0f7603f8c56fce96e92253f99c65c58ffcee6005944f16934ba0fa1274", "ja": "あっ、みんな！　ごめんなさい、急に……。\nでも今日の成功は、この公園のおかげなんです。", "zh": "啊，大家！对不起，突然说这些……  \n不过，今天能成功，多亏了这个公园。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "0dd7da0c123984811df930462d9bfc82395c1b871a0387df2a3ee38f774012dc", "ja": "この公園が、世代を超えて愛される場所だからこそ、\nステージが盛り上がったと思うんです！　だから……。", "zh": "正因为这座公园是一个跨越世代、深受大家喜爱的地方，我觉得舞台才能如此热闹！所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1013_mirionpakuenntyou", "source_sha256": "3c949dcdc9cde5325c78be9b56982570b982e9c7a69f501009fc0a72e9d943b7", "ja": "みなさんのお気持ちはわかりました。\nですがやはり、老朽化した施設は危険ですので……。", "zh": "大家的心情我都明白了。\n但老化的设施果然还是太危险了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "739fce3b959eed1489fb379f8310b2459df98009f7aabaf9c19ac61e42ec2c4e", "ja": "やっぱりダメ～！？　くっ、こうなったら……。\n{$P$}ちゃん、いくらか包んで！", "zh": "还是不行吗～！？可恶，事到如今……\n{$P$}，快塞点红包！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1015_mirionpakuenntyou", "source_sha256": "feb63e88680be51895d3211efd78da94f68374380ea3507ff08e33b20baf5fca", "ja": "一部の遊具は、撤去しなければいけません。そこで……\n改めて、公園のリニューアルを検討しようと思います。", "zh": "部分游乐设施必须拆除。因此……\n我想重新考虑一下公园的翻新。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "da5d94f822eadc824c84646e6d357a52efb3b533e63f855c3c3b17c811d613fd", "ja": "本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！\n亜美、みんなも、良かったな！", "zh": "真的吗！？谢谢你们！\n亚美，大家也太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "d74bf6c3744405bf8d2ccbf6ae03ac41c18e244b9da7588b87d4fdb8db0b79f3", "ja": "えっ。それじゃ、公園残してくれるってコト！？", "zh": "诶，也就是说，你们愿意把公园留下来！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "1fff852b09a33e58d5eb8c4bd7643d4aac13fadce24a3c657d5966547b617bcb", "ja": "うそっ、本当に！？\nやった……やったわよ、亜美ちゃん！", "zh": "骗人，真的吗！？\n太好了……太好啦，亚美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "f13fe1a4206b6d9f5322bb9fcc1b700c17de454fd4236ec763b6d57995ae16b0", "ja": "すっげー！　亜美、よかったじゃん！\n逆転サヨナラ満塁ホームランの気分だぜ～♪", "zh": "太棒了！亜美，恭喜你啊！\n这感觉就像逆转再见满垒本垒打一样～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "bc1b735fa788d68a78c7a5b26ff7ae1572adfcb03114d9fd8a06fd17f6a40fce", "ja": "んっふっふっふ～！\n亜美たちならこれくらい、当然だよ！　ね、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "嗯哼哼哼～！\n这点程度对我们来说当然啦！对吧，哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "cc97a41f72b15f80ad4a987a09ef9562f34e6900398abc4139274f69a427899f", "ja": "さてと……みんな、忘れ物はないな？\nそれじゃ、撤収しよう。", "zh": "好了……大家，都没有忘带东西吧？\n那么，我们收工吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "0b8d9312e70b76f6ad5b59fbea0dcce39b8d46ba543479e6b0819ae36660f4ad", "ja": "お疲れさま！　とっても楽しいお仕事だったわね。\nミリオンパークには、またプライべートで来たいわ♪", "zh": "辛苦啦！这次的工作真的特别开心呢。\n以后还想以私人行程再来百万公园♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "56f34dfba5fbd7b2a04445a3e3333fbfb8f61d514b906dc7722a6fe07f7552fa", "ja": "次は、劇場のみんなも連れて来ようよ！\nいつにしよっか？　明日とか？", "zh": "下次把剧场的大家也都带来吧！\n定在什么时候好呢？明天怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1024_p", "source_sha256": "ddad9f8d8541a8652211a7b2110c6261834da87b31fc2b12990e2c83342f5dba", "ja": "そんなに急がなくても……。\nミリオンパークは、すぐなくなったりしないぞ。", "zh": "不用那么着急……。\n百万乐园不会马上消失的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "2b496bde5f8ecdf106e9f8052fc1a2e5b2a6930bc73b2cb3dd24a1582d8ed90a", "ja": "あんなにたくさんの人に、大切にされてるんだもんな！\nオレたちの劇場も、こんな風になれるといいな～。", "zh": "毕竟被那么多人珍惜着嘛！\n要是我们的剧场也能变成这样就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "b2bd00b61beb41a39eb8c53dea84e356c5b0cb477c8be166ca866e4d30f36780", "ja": "そうね！　私たちの劇場も、ずっと大切に思って\nもらえるような……そんな場所にしていきたいわね！", "zh": "是啊！我也希望我们的剧场能成为一个……永远被大家珍视的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "623275a529629a0076835f5f0023d061c17e6fc29b311efe439826ebe1b82c9c", "ja": "そうですね、本当にそう思います。", "zh": "是啊，我真的也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "0ce76ffdebed8b909b374ac5db9ef5b22e3076e57aacfe5bb2f976ce9e840358", "ja": "ふっふっふ……イイ話でまとまりかけてるようだけど、\n茜ちゃんは今こそ宣言するよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……看起来事情正要朝着圆满结局发展，不过，\n小茜现在就要宣布！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "10d3133d9a592acfdb2aa9efea73b4252423cc45f02f0bc6a5959c90c4333c02", "ja": "ミリオンパークに、茜ちゃん千年王国を樹立するとね！\nこの公園は、茜ちゃんのモノだーっ！", "zh": "要在百万公园建立小茜千年王国！  \n这个公园是小茜的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1030_011ami", "source_sha256": "990d21573986d23910bed06e1eddd4cd93da1d49a3bfca6ebc092fda323f2ff2", "ja": "おっと、そう簡単にいくかな……？\nまずは、このジャングルキング亜美が相手だよ！", "zh": "哎呀，事情会这么简单吗……？\n首先，就让丛林之王亚美来当你的对手吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "2817b3d99164a0736e8d4126c74bd2691a3fe99d4d9480318f7a929425f7ebd5", "ja": "これは予想外の展開！　けど、茜ちゃんは負けない！\nこの公園を、世界制覇の足がかりとするのだー！", "zh": "这真是出乎意料的发展！不过，小茜是不会输的！\n就把这个公园作为征服世界的跳板吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a22dc9222cb1a226a5f53cb51c32092c789f3acb3a88bd45201c0142117ad76c", "ja": "ふたりとも、まだじゃれあう体力が残ってるのか……。\n若さってのはすごいな。", "zh": "你们两个居然还有力气打闹啊……\n年轻真是了不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "45c5f7e03f04b61f597d5c7579b5746926dc10fce16f791f1f99c62e8479231c", "ja": "あら、{$P$}ったら大人アピール？\nでもそうね、今回は『いい大人』をしてくれたものね。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}是在强调自己是个大人吗？\n不过也是呢，这次你确实表现得像个“合格的大人”嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "5bb9e6b1a01aeaadf4bcda691952f07fac757fb6cf2c2573df043c9de2fe3918", "ja": "あの園長さんを呼んだのって、\n{$P$}なんでしょう？", "zh": "把那位园长请过来的，\n其实是{$P$}吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1035_p", "source_sha256": "dd2a26b8c8ccf609d06f87f53265dda6d69a3bc381f73ef43a62fecac0d9ad1d", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、まあ……。\nライブを観に来てくださいって、連絡はしましたけど。", "zh": "诶？啊，算是吧……。\n我是联系过园长，请他来看演出的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1036_011ami", "source_sha256": "63e06acbd2df981ccaabeb483800f67cbbbe9f4a4771420f93373d03c44e3e92", "ja": "えっ、そうだったの！？\nつまり……兄ちゃんが全てのクロマクだったってこと？", "zh": "诶，原来是这样啊！？\n也就是说……哥哥才是一切的幕后黑手？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1037_p", "source_sha256": "5df2a07be62b3042fb7596fd27b49d7161440098119639c287b7e4b866a6e061", "ja": "人聞きが悪いな……。\n関係者の方をご招待しただけだよ、いつもみたいに！", "zh": "这话听起来可不太好……  \n我只是像平时一样，邀请相关人士来参加而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1038_011ami", "source_sha256": "363da85a3bdce28af0ecd0cec93a59acd9da5453fbc3ad723df6be0029cd68f9", "ja": "そっか～……。\nやっぱり兄ちゃんって、ヤリ手なんだね♪", "zh": "这样啊～……  \n果然哥哥很能干呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1039_011ami", "source_sha256": "bd3190863238c5823736e608a4008774538d37948b9813cf1a89b6129c0418c0", "ja": "ありがとね、兄ちゃん！\nそんな兄ちゃんに……亜美がお礼をあげるよ！", "zh": "谢谢你啦，哥！\n亚美要给这样的哥……一份谢礼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_1040", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d2d94bf46fa268ba299f4b2406e52e617cd4768d529ea9c7c3f40dec0bc2e63a", "ja": "いや、別にそんな、お礼なんか……。うん？", "zh": "不，倒也不用特意谢我……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2008_p", "source_sha256": "658ba8a2e7b6d981671575a1d8cb5ffd19e1923786b4aaa96941dce5649d8188", "ja": "……なんだこれ……水風船？", "zh": "……这是什么……水球？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2001_011ami", "source_sha256": "b70c42b55f1cee8fb5a5b0eb7652838d924b76282b82a97ff5aac11e9debd468", "ja": "そうそう♪　そんでもって、このつまようじで。", "zh": "没错♪然后用这根牙签。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2002_se", "source_sha256": "038cd88703e49cfab181c1c6c3cd910ee2b9298bf7dc7dd96fb00396dc22ea67", "ja": "パァン！　バシャーッ！", "zh": "砰！哗啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2004_011ami", "source_sha256": "0637ad264fa2b4cfb4641176949bb563b005097286edcbd605a31ced3ecbe149", "ja": "おおっ！　兄ちゃん、水も滴るいいオトコ♪\nそれ、逃っげろ～～～～！！", "zh": "哦哦！哥哥，真是水淋淋的帅哥♪\n快逃啊～～～～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "df05181810c977c81ea0cf1d74be0c5837e8bb5dc2638dd749c72b02e992bab0", "ja": "あはは♪　やられたわね、{$P$}？\n私のタオル貸してあげるから、拭きなさい！", "zh": "啊哈哈♪ 被收拾得够呛吧，{$P$}？\n我把毛巾借给你，擦一擦吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0133_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0133_story_07_2006_p", "source_sha256": "c7cf2ef1b318b4a17a2324b6c1134c84b6af8053a1faf4774a6d8a089ccf19aa", "ja": "（しまった、油断した……。\nプロデュースは、油断せずにいかないとな）", "zh": "（糟糕，一不小心就大意了……制作人的工作可不能掉以轻心啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
